OL,3,GNEWSADemand soars for free school
OL,4,Auniform, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which offers free school
OL,7,Funiforms says it has helped more than
OL,8,F100 children prepare for the new school
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FDoreen's, based at North Point Shopping
OL,12,FCentre in Hull, repurposes unwanted
OL,13,Funiforms and gives them to families
OL,14,Facross the city free of charge.
OL,16,FAshleigh Hirst, the charity's
OL,17,Fco-founder, said: "The demand is so
OL,18,Fhigh so we are just wanting to help
OL,19,Fwith whatever we can."
